          "actualOutput": "=== Audit Probabilitas: Mengapa Margin Mentah SVM Bukan Probabilitas (Prevalensi=21.1%) ===\nRentang skor mentah decision_function(X_te): [-5.169, +4.613]\nMetode                              | Mean(p) | Brier   | LogLoss | ECE(8-bin)\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1. BUG: sigmoid(raw_margin) mentah  |  0.4100 | 0.15408 | 0.46296 | 0.20048\n2. SAFE: SVM + Platt (CalibratedCV) |  0.2186 | 0.10271 | 0.32880 | 0.02496\n3. Baseline: LogisticRegression L2  |  0.2145 | 0.10242 | 0.32660 | 0.03377",
