          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.optimize import minimize\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(11)\nn_half = 30\n# Klaster sedikit tumpang tindih agar KETIGA rezim KKT (Non-SV, Free SV, Bounded SV) muncul nyata!\nX_neg = rng.normal(loc=[-0.95, -0.85], scale=[0.85, 0.85], size=(n_half, 2))\nX_pos = rng.normal(loc=[+0.95, +0.85], scale=[0.85, 0.85], size=(n_half, 2))\nX = np.vstack([X_neg, X_pos])\ny = np.concatenate([-np.ones(n_half), np.ones(n_half)])\nC_val = 1.5\n\ndef solve_wolfe_dual_qp(X_mat, y_vec, C_box):\n    n_s = len(y_vec)\n    # Matriks Q_ij = y_i y_j (x_i^T x_j)\n    K = X_mat @ X_mat.T\n    Q = np.outer(y_vec, y_vec) * K\n\n    def neg_dual(alpha):\n        return 0.5 * float(alpha @ (Q @ alpha)) - float(np.sum(alpha))\n\n    def neg_dual_jac(alpha):\n        return (Q @ alpha) - np.ones(n_s)\n\n    cons = {\"type\": \"eq\", \"fun\": lambda a: float(np.dot(a, y_vec)), \"jac\": lambda a: y_vec}\n    bounds = [(0.0, C_box)] * n_s\n    res = minimize(\n        neg_dual,\n        np.zeros(n_s),\n        jac=neg_dual_jac,\n        method=\"SLSQP\",\n        bounds=bounds,\n        constraints=cons,\n        options={\"ftol\": 1e-11, \"maxiter\": 600},\n    )\n    alpha = np.clip(res.x, 0.0, C_box)\n    w = (alpha * y_vec) @ X_mat\n    # Estimasi bias stabil: rata-rata atas seluruh Free Support Vectors (0 < alpha_i < C)\n    free_mask = (alpha > 1e-4) & (alpha < C_box - 1e-4)\n    b = float(np.mean(y_vec[free_mask] - X_mat[free_mask] @ w))\n    return alpha, w, b\n\nalpha_full, w_full, b_full = solve_wolfe_dual_qp(X, y, C_val)\n\n# Klasifikasi 3 rezim KKT\ntol = 1e-4\nnon_sv = alpha_full <= tol\nfree_sv = (alpha_full > tol) & (alpha_full < C_val - tol)\nbounded_sv = alpha_full >= (C_val - tol)\nsv_mask = ~non_sv\n\n# Hitung Primal vs Dual Objective & Duality Gap\nmargins = y * (X @ w_full + b_full)\nslacks = np.maximum(0.0, 1.0 - margins)\nprimal_obj = 0.5 * float(np.dot(w_full, w_full)) + C_val * float(np.sum(slacks))\ndual_obj = float(np.sum(alpha_full)) - 0.5 * float(np.dot(w_full, w_full))\nduality_gap = abs(primal_obj - dual_obj)\n\n# Cek Complementary Slackness: alpha_i * (y_i f(x_i) - 1 + xi_i) == 0 dan (C - alpha_i)*xi_i == 0\ncomp_1 = float(np.max(np.abs(alpha_full * (margins - 1.0 + slacks))))\ncomp_2 = float(np.max(np.abs((C_val - alpha_full) * slacks)))\n\n# BUKTI SPARSITY: Hapus SEMUA Non-SV, latih ulang Wolfe Dual hanya pada Support Vectors!\nalpha_sv_only, w_sv_only, b_sv_only = solve_wolfe_dual_qp(X[sv_mask], y[sv_mask], C_val)\nw_diff = float(np.linalg.norm(w_full - w_sv_only))\nb_diff = abs(b_full - b_sv_only)\n\nprint(\"=== Solusi Eksak Wolfe Dual QP & Verifikasi Kondisi KKT (N=60, C=1.5) ===\")\nprint(f\"Primal Obj = {primal_obj:.6f} | Dual Obj = {dual_obj:.6f} | Duality Gap = {duality_gap:.2e}\")\nprint(f\"Rezim KKT  : Non-SV (alpha=0)={int(np.sum(non_sv)):2d} | Free SV (0<a<C)={int(np.sum(free_sv)):2d} | Bounded SV (a=C)={int(np.sum(bounded_sv)):2d}\")\nprint(f\"Max KKT Complementary Slackness residual: term1={comp_1:.2e} | term2={comp_2:.2e}\")\nprint(f\"Kontrol Sparsity (hapus {int(np.sum(non_sv))} Non-SV lalu retrain): ||dw||_2={w_diff:.2e} | |db|={b_diff:.2e}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Solusi Eksak Wolfe Dual QP & Verifikasi Kondisi KKT (N=60, C=1.5) ===\nPrimal Obj = 6.307185 | Dual Obj = 6.307185 | Duality Gap = 2.82e-08\nRezim KKT  : Non-SV (alpha=0)=53 | Free SV (0<a<C)= 3 | Bounded SV (a=C)= 4\nMax KKT Complementary Slackness residual: term1=1.62e-08 | term2=3.70e-14\nKontrol Sparsity (hapus 53 Non-SV lalu retrain): ||dw||_2=3.41e-07 | |db|=5.06e-08",
          "actualOutput": "=== Solusi Eksak Wolfe Dual QP & Verifikasi Kondisi KKT (N=60, C=1.5) ===\nPrimal Obj = 6.307185 | Dual Obj = 6.307185 | Duality Gap = 2.82e-08\nRezim KKT  : Non-SV (alpha=0)=53 | Free SV (0<a<C)= 3 | Bounded SV (a=C)= 4\nMax KKT Complementary Slackness residual: term1=1.62e-08 | term2=3.70e-14\nKontrol Sparsity (hapus 53 Non-SV lalu retrain): ||dw||_2=3.41e-07 | |db|=5.06e-08",
