          "filename": "11_3_primal_linear_svr_vs_ridge.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(42)\nn_tr, n_te, d = 220, 120, 3\nX_tr = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_tr, d))\nX_te = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_te, d))\nw_true = np.array([2.2, -1.5, 0.9])\nb_true = 1.4\n\n# Sinyal sensor bersih + noise Gaussian sigma=0.25\ny_tr = X_tr @ w_true + b_true + rng.normal(0.0, 0.25, size=n_tr)\ny_te_clean = X_te @ w_true + b_true + rng.normal(0.0, 0.25, size=n_te)\n\n# Kontaminasi 12% outlier lonjakan ekstrem pada data latih (kegagalan sensor sesaat)\nout_idx = rng.choice(n_tr, size=26, replace=False)\ny_tr[out_idx] += rng.choice([-1.0, 1.0], size=26) * rng.uniform(8.0, 14.0, size=26)\n\ndef fit_linear_svr_primal(X_mat, y_vec, C_val=1.5, eps=0.30, steps=3000):\n    \"\"\"Minimasi 0.5*||w||^2 + C * sum(max(0, |y_i - (w^T x_i + b)| - eps)).\"\"\"\n    w = np.zeros(X_mat.shape[1])\n    b = float(np.median(y_vec))\n    best_obj = np.inf\n    best_w, best_b = w.copy(), b\n    for t in range(1, steps + 1):\n        resid = (X_mat @ w + b) - y_vec  # f(x) - y\n        # Subgradien loss L_eps: +1 jika resid > eps, -1 jika resid < -eps, 0 di dalam tabung\n        s = np.where(resid > eps, 1.0, np.where(resid < -eps, -1.0, 0.0))\n        grad_w = w + C_val * (X_mat.T @ s)\n        grad_b = C_val * float(np.sum(s))\n        eta = 0.08 / (1.0 + 0.02 * t)\n        w = w - eta * grad_w\n        b = b - eta * grad_b\n        if t % 20 == 0 or t == steps:\n            r = np.abs(y_vec - (X_mat @ w + b))\n            obj = 0.5 * float(np.dot(w, w)) + C_val * float(np.sum(np.maximum(0.0, r - eps)))\n            if obj < best_obj:\n                best_obj = obj\n                best_w, best_b = w.copy(), float(b)\n    return best_w, best_b\n\nw_svr, b_svr = fit_linear_svr_primal(X_tr, y_tr, C_val=1.5, eps=0.30)\n\n# Pembanding Ridge L2 tertutup pada data terkontaminasi yang sama\nA_tr = np.column_stack([np.ones(n_tr), X_tr])\nreg = np.diag([0.0] + [1.0] * d)\ntheta_ridge = np.linalg.solve(A_tr.T @ A_tr + reg, A_tr.T @ y_tr)\nb_ridge, w_ridge = float(theta_ridge[0]), theta_ridge[1:]\n\n# Audit zona tabung epsilon pada data latih & akurasi uji bersih\nabs_err_tr = np.abs(y_tr - (X_tr @ w_svr + b_svr))\nin_tube = int(np.sum(abs_err_tr <= 0.30))\nout_tube = n_tr - in_tube\n\npred_svr = X_te @ w_svr + b_svr\npred_ridge = X_te @ w_ridge + b_ridge\n\nprint(\"=== First-Principles Primal Linear SVR vs Ridge (12% Sensor Spike Outliers) ===\")\nprint(f\"Bobot sejati w_true  : {np.round(w_true, 3)} | b_true={b_true:.3f}\")\nprint(f\"Estimasi Linear SVR  : {np.round(w_svr, 3)} | b_svr ={b_svr:.3f} (tahan lonjakan!)\")\nprint(f\"Estimasi Ridge (L2)  : {np.round(w_ridge, 3)} | b_rdg ={b_ridge:.3f} (terdistorsi outlier!)\")\nprint(f\"Zona Tabung (eps=0.3): {in_tube}/{n_tr} ({100*in_tube/n_tr:.1f}%) ber-loss=0 | {out_tube} pelanggar tabung\")\nprint(f\"Test MAE  (bersih)   : SVR={np.mean(np.abs(y_te_clean - pred_svr)):.4f} vs Ridge={np.mean(np.abs(y_te_clean - pred_ridge)):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"Test RMSE (bersih)   : SVR={np.sqrt(np.mean((y_te_clean - pred_svr)**2)):.4f} vs Ridge={np.sqrt(np.mean((y_te_clean - pred_ridge)**2)):.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== First-Principles Primal Linear SVR vs Ridge (12% Sensor Spike Outliers) ===\nBobot sejati w_true  : [ 2.2 -1.5  0.9] | b_true=1.400\nEstimasi Linear SVR  : [ 2.186 -1.458  0.859] | b_svr =1.403 (tahan lonjakan!)\nEstimasi Ridge (L2)  : [ 2.385 -1.283  0.586] | b_rdg =1.299 (terdistorsi outlier!)\nZona Tabung (eps=0.3): 150/220 (68.2%) ber-loss=0 | 70 pelanggar tabung\nTest MAE  (bersih)   : SVR=0.2067 vs Ridge=0.3789\nTest RMSE (bersih)   : SVR=0.2601 vs Ridge=0.4569",
          "actualOutput": "=== First-Principles Primal Linear SVR vs Ridge (12% Sensor Spike Outliers) ===\nBobot sejati w_true  : [ 2.2 -1.5  0.9] | b_true=1.400\nEstimasi Linear SVR  : [ 2.186 -1.458  0.859] | b_svr =1.403 (tahan lonjakan!)\nEstimasi Ridge (L2)  : [ 2.385 -1.283  0.586] | b_rdg =1.299 (terdistorsi outlier!)\nZona Tabung (eps=0.3): 150/220 (68.2%) ber-loss=0 | 70 pelanggar tabung\nTest MAE  (bersih)   : SVR=0.2067 vs Ridge=0.3789\nTest RMSE (bersih)   : SVR=0.2601 vs Ridge=0.4569",
