          "filename": "11_4_pegasos_projected_sgd.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_classification\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom sklearn.svm import LinearSVC\n\nX_raw, y_01 = make_classification(\n    n_samples=1200, n_features=25, n_informative=12, n_redundant=4,\n    class_sep=1.25, random_state=42\n)\ny_pm = np.where(y_01 == 1, 1.0, -1.0)\nX_tr, X_te, y_tr, y_te = train_test_split(X_raw, y_pm, test_size=0.30, stratify=y_pm, random_state=42)\n\nsc = StandardScaler().fit(X_tr)\nX_tr_s = np.column_stack([sc.transform(X_tr), np.ones(len(X_tr))])  # serap bias ke fitur akhir\nX_te_s = np.column_stack([sc.transform(X_te), np.ones(len(X_te))])\n\ndef primal_hinge_obj(X_mat, y_vec, w_vec, lam_val):\n    hinge = np.maximum(0.0, 1.0 - y_vec * (X_mat @ w_vec))\n    return 0.5 * lam_val * float(np.dot(w_vec, w_vec)) + float(np.mean(hinge))\n\n# Implementasi Pegasos (Shalev-Shwartz et al., 2011) dengan mini-batch k=16 & proyeksi bola L2\nlam = 0.01\nk_batch = 16\nrng = np.random.default_rng(42)\nn_tr, d_aug = X_tr_s.shape\nw = np.zeros(d_aug)\nradius = 1.0 / np.sqrt(lam)\n\nprint(f\"=== Konvergensi Pegasos Projected Subgradient SVM (lambda={lam}, k={k_batch}, R={radius:.1f}) ===\")\nprint(\" Step t | Primal_Obj | ||w||_2 | Acc_Train | Acc_Test\")\nprint(\"-\" * 56)\nfor t in range(1, 3001):\n    idx = rng.integers(0, n_tr, size=k_batch)\n    Xb, yb = X_tr_s[idx], y_tr[idx]\n    eta_t = 1.0 / (lam * t)\n    viol = (yb * (Xb @ w)) < 1.0\n    # Pembaruan subgradien stokastik + penyusutan (1 - 1/t)\n    w_half = (1.0 - 1.0 / t) * w + (eta_t / k_batch) * (Xb[viol].T @ yb[viol])\n    # Proyeksi opsional ke bola L2 berjari-jari 1/sqrt(lambda)\n    norm_half = float(np.linalg.norm(w_half))\n    if norm_half > radius:\n        w = w_half * (radius / norm_half)\n    else:\n        w = w_half\n    if t in (50, 200, 800, 3000):\n        obj = primal_hinge_obj(X_tr_s, y_tr, w, lam)\n        acc_tr = float(np.mean(np.sign(X_tr_s @ w) == y_tr))\n        acc_te = float(np.mean(np.sign(X_te_s @ w) == y_te))\n        print(f\"{t:7d} | {obj:10.5f} | {np.linalg.norm(w):7.4f} | {acc_tr:9.4f} | {acc_te:8.4f}\")\n\n# Verifikasi kesesuaian dengan LinearSVC(loss=\"hinge\") pada C = 1/(n*lam)\nC_eq = 1.0 / (n_tr * lam)\nlsvc = LinearSVC(loss=\"hinge\", C=C_eq, dual=True, max_iter=5000, random_state=42)\nlsvc.fit(sc.transform(X_tr), (y_tr > 0).astype(int))\nacc_lsvc = float(np.mean(lsvc.predict(sc.transform(X_te)) == (y_te > 0).astype(int)))\nprint(f\"Pembanding LinearSVC(loss='hinge', C={C_eq:.3f}): Acc_Test = {acc_lsvc:.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Konvergensi Pegasos Projected Subgradient SVM (lambda=0.01, k=16, R=10.0) ===\n Step t | Primal_Obj | ||w||_2 | Acc_Train | Acc_Test\n--------------------------------------------------------\n     50 |    0.70566 |  4.5678 |    0.8155 |   0.8361\n    200 |    0.36542 |  2.2208 |    0.8631 |   0.8750\n    800 |    0.35074 |  2.0887 |    0.8714 |   0.8861\n   3000 |    0.33917 |  1.9236 |    0.8714 |   0.8917\nPembanding LinearSVC(loss='hinge', C=0.119): Acc_Test = 0.8917",
          "actualOutput": "=== Konvergensi Pegasos Projected Subgradient SVM (lambda=0.01, k=16, R=10.0) ===\n Step t | Primal_Obj | ||w||_2 | Acc_Train | Acc_Test\n--------------------------------------------------------\n     50 |    0.70566 |  4.5678 |    0.8155 |   0.8361\n    200 |    0.36542 |  2.2208 |    0.8631 |   0.8750\n    800 |    0.35074 |  2.0887 |    0.8714 |   0.8861\n   3000 |    0.33917 |  1.9236 |    0.8714 |   0.8917\nPembanding LinearSVC(loss='hinge', C=0.119): Acc_Test = 0.8917",
          "explanation": "Mengimplementasikan solver Pegasos dengan step deterministik 1/(lambda*t) dan proyeksi bola 1/sqrt(lambda), melacak penurunan objektif primal serta memverifikasi akurasi uji terhadap LinearSVC(loss='hinge').",
