          "id": "code-ml-11-4-ch11_4_sklearn",
          "title": "Scikit-Learn 1.9: LinearSVC(dual='auto'), SGD partial_fit & Calibration",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "11_4_sparse_linearsvc_sgd_calibration.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy import sparse\nfrom sklearn.calibration import CalibratedClassifierCV\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import SGDClassifier\nfrom sklearn.metrics import accuracy_score, brier_score_loss, log_loss, roc_auc_score\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import normalize\nfrom sklearn.svm import LinearSVC\n\n# Simulasi korpus TF-IDF sparse berdimensi tinggi (d=4000 > n_train=700, ~2.5% nnz, L2-normalized)\nrng = np.random.default_rng(42)\nn_docs, d_vocab = 1000, 4000\ny = rng.integers(0, 2, size=n_docs)\n# 60 token kata kunci kelas-spesifik + 3.940 token latar belakang sparse\nX_bg = sparse.random(\n    n_docs, d_vocab - 60, density=0.02, format=\"csr\", random_state=42,\n    data_rvs=lambda s: rng.uniform(0.2, 1.0, size=s)\n)\nsig_rows, sig_cols, sig_vals = [], [], []\nfor i in range(n_docs):\n    # Dokumen kelas 1 cenderung memakai token 0..29; kelas 0 cenderung memakai token 30..59\n    base_col = 0 if y[i] == 1 else 30\n    chosen = rng.choice(np.arange(base_col, base_col + 30), size=5, replace=False)\n    for c in chosen:\n        sig_rows.append(i)\n        sig_cols.append(int(c))\n        sig_vals.append(float(rng.uniform(0.8, 1.8)))\n    # Tambahkan 1 token silang sebagai noise alami bahasa\n    opp_col = int(rng.integers(30 - base_col, 60 - base_col))\n    sig_rows.append(i)\n    sig_cols.append(opp_col)\n    sig_vals.append(float(rng.uniform(0.5, 1.2)))\nX_sig = sparse.csr_matrix((sig_vals, (sig_rows, sig_cols)), shape=(n_docs, 60))\nX_sp = normalize(sparse.hstack([X_sig, X_bg], format=\"csr\"), norm=\"l2\")\n\nX_tr, X_te, y_tr, y_te = train_test_split(X_sp, y, test_size=0.30, stratify=y, random_state=42)\n\n# 1) LinearSVC(dual=\"auto\") pada d > n: otomatis memakai Dual Coordinate Descent (LIBLINEAR)\nlsvc_auto = LinearSVC(C=0.8, loss=\"squared_hinge\", dual=\"auto\", max_iter=2000, random_state=42)\nlsvc_auto.fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n\n# 2) Streaming Out-of-Core SGDClassifier(loss=\"hinge\") lewat partial_fit per mini-batch\nsgd_stream = SGDClassifier(loss=\"hinge\", alpha=1e-3, learning_rate=\"optimal\", random_state=42)\nclasses = np.array([0, 1])\nbatch_size = 140\nfor epoch in range(10):\n    perm = rng.permutation(X_tr.shape[0])\n    for start in range(0, X_tr.shape[0], batch_size):\n        b_idx = perm[start:start + batch_size]\n        sgd_stream.partial_fit(X_tr[b_idx], y_tr[b_idx], classes=classes)\n\n# 3) Kalibrasi Probabilitas Skala Besar: CalibratedClassifierCV(..., ensemble=False)\ncal_lsvc = CalibratedClassifierCV(\n    LinearSVC(C=0.8, loss=\"squared_hinge\", dual=\"auto\", max_iter=2000, random_state=42),\n    method=\"sigmoid\", cv=5, ensemble=False,\n).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n\ncal_sgd = CalibratedClassifierCV(\n    SGDClassifier(loss=\"hinge\", alpha=1e-3, max_iter=500, random_state=42),\n    method=\"sigmoid\", cv=5, ensemble=False,\n).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n\nprint(\"=== Benchmark SVM Skala Besar pada Matriks Sparse CSR (N_tr=700, d=4000, TF-IDF L2) ===\")\nprint(f\"LinearSVC(dual='auto')  : Acc={accuracy_score(y_te, lsvc_auto.predict(X_te)):.4f} | AUROC={roc_auc_score(y_te, lsvc_auto.decision_function(X_te)):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"SGD(hinge) partial_fit  : Acc={accuracy_score(y_te, sgd_stream.predict(X_te)):.4f} | AUROC={roc_auc_score(y_te, sgd_stream.decision_function(X_te)):.4f}\")\nprint(\"--- Setelah Dibungkus CalibratedClassifierCV(method='sigmoid', cv=5, ensemble=False) ---\")\nfor label, model in [(\"Calibrated LinearSVC\", cal_lsvc), (\"Calibrated SGD-Hinge\", cal_sgd)]:\n    p = model.predict_proba(X_te)[:, 1]\n    print(f\"  {label:20s} | Acc={accuracy_score(y_te, p >= 0.5):.4f} | AUROC={roc_auc_score(y_te, p):.4f} | Brier={brier_score_loss(y_te, p):.4f} | LogLoss={log_loss(y_te, p):.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Benchmark SVM Skala Besar pada Matriks Sparse CSR (N_tr=700, d=4000, TF-IDF L2) ===\nLinearSVC(dual='auto')  : Acc=1.0000 | AUROC=1.0000\nSGD(hinge) partial_fit  : Acc=1.0000 | AUROC=1.0000\n--- Setelah Dibungkus CalibratedClassifierCV(method='sigmoid', cv=5, ensemble=False) ---\n  Calibrated LinearSVC | Acc=1.0000 | AUROC=1.0000 | Brier=0.0000 | LogLoss=0.0027\n  Calibrated SGD-Hinge | Acc=1.0000 | AUROC=1.0000 | Brier=0.0000 | LogLoss=0.0032",
          "actualOutput": "=== Benchmark SVM Skala Besar pada Matriks Sparse CSR (N_tr=700, d=4000, TF-IDF L2) ===\nLinearSVC(dual='auto')  : Acc=1.0000 | AUROC=1.0000\nSGD(hinge) partial_fit  : Acc=1.0000 | AUROC=1.0000\n--- Setelah Dibungkus CalibratedClassifierCV(method='sigmoid', cv=5, ensemble=False) ---\n  Calibrated LinearSVC | Acc=1.0000 | AUROC=1.0000 | Brier=0.0000 | LogLoss=0.0027\n  Calibrated SGD-Hinge | Acc=1.0000 | AUROC=1.0000 | Brier=0.0000 | LogLoss=0.0032",
          "explanation": "Melatih LinearSVC(dual='auto') dan streaming SGDClassifier(loss='hinge') partial_fit pada matriks sparse CSR d=4000, lalu membungkus keduanya dengan CalibratedClassifierCV(ensemble=False) untuk mengaudit Brier Score dan Log-Loss.",
